   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Pellucid Sensors was compliant with all three covenants on its Venture Term Loan for the period ended October 31, 2026. The bank's calculations agree with the compliance certificate on each covenant. The most notable change is a narrowing of the Minimum Unrestricted Cash cushion since August, now {{fact:a8d34e6d-7944-42a3-a427-b5ba27eedff6}}, which the early warning system flagged as a low-severity signal. Unrestricted cash of {{fact:9eded154-4a97-4052-9152-04adb81692ad}} remains above the {{fact:42ababe7-9a58-48b0-a9ae-6b34d1c02184}} minimum, and no open work items are recorded.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Runway was calculated at {{fact:e8697200-2ffe-483c-b783-8d69227ab99d}} against a required {{fact:86958e88-7527-4876-bd01-0058e4ecc95a}}, a cushion of {{fact:ffbf7b30-106b-4465-8484-ed92208e31ef}}. The certificate reports {{fact:6f25b5f1-b4c8-45d0-b06e-c015ec202bf6}}. Minimum Unrestricted Cash was {{fact:9eded154-4a97-4052-9152-04adb81692ad}} against a required {{fact:42ababe7-9a58-48b0-a9ae-6b34d1c02184}}, a cushion of {{fact:a8d34e6d-7944-42a3-a427-b5ba27eedff6}}. The certificate reports {{fact:71a072ae-1d97-499c-8674-d3ab6d84d03b}}. Revenue to Plan was {{fact:7f99a4d7-47e2-425b-b4d0-9e0cb14ac053}} against a required {{fact:effb6a0e-e68e-4e0b-babb-1c3e9e3ffb84}}, a cushion of {{fact:e20c1b0a-a0be-437b-8f91-2338e76c4c02}}. The certificate reports {{fact:168a98f6-d411-49b5-a43b-460b1cf1611b}}. The reported figures match the bank's calculations, and the certificate's claim of compliance on all three covenants is consistent with them.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"One early warning signal fired, rated low severity. The Minimum Unrestricted Cash cushion has narrowed steadily between August and October, and it now stands at {{fact:a8d34e6d-7944-42a3-a427-b5ba27eedff6}}. The signal attributes this to ongoing cash burn and treats it as a trend concern rather than an imminent breach. No other signal fired to confirm or explain it. The facts held for this period do not include revenue, earnings or monthly cash movements. A reviewer may therefore want to test the narrowing cash cushion against the runway calculation of {{fact:e8697200-2ffe-483c-b783-8d69227ab99d}}. No work items are open.\"}]}",
